  "captions": [
    {"start": 2.7, "end": 4.6, "text": "Even in 2026, everyone keeps saying…"},
    {"start": 4.6, "end": 6.7, "text": "“coding is not required.”"},
    {"start": 6.9, "end": 9.7, "text": "So — Ram and Lakshman, the brothers."},
    {"start": 13.9, "end": 16.6, "text": "…the kingdom on the east side."},
    {"start": 16.9, "end": 18.4, "text": "So, what's the task for these two?"},
    {"start": 18.4, "end": 19.9, "text": "To build an app using AI."},
    {"start": 44.2, "end": 46.6, "text": "Of course, Lakshman's app is better…"},
    {"start": 46.6, "end": 50.3, "text": "Lakshman wins, and takes the kingdom."},
    {"start": 50.6, "end": 51.9, "text": "And what did Ram do?"},
    {"start": 51.9, "end": 53.4, "text": "Nothing."},
    {"start": 53.6, "end": 57.4, "text": "In 2026, coding is not about writing syntax."},
    {"start": 57.6, "end": 63.4, "text": "Coding is about solving complex problems…"},
    {"start": 63.6, "end": 67.4, "text": "…using AI to solve them."},
    {"start": 67.6, "end": 70.4, "text": "Don't just learn syntax."},
    {"start": 70.4, "end": 73.4, "text": "Learn the process."},
    {"start": 73.6, "end": 75.8, "text": "Learn architecture."},
    {"start": 75.8, "end": 79.4, "text": "Learn what happens behind the structure."},
    {"start": 79.6, "end": 83.2, "text": "As humans, our job isn't writing code —"},
    {"start": 83.2, "end": 87.4, "text": "it's judging the code AI gives us."},
    {"start": 87.6, "end": 90.3, "text": "In the AI era."}
  ]
}
